      "content": "Common Room Core REST APIs for getting data in to Common Room.\n<br/><br/>\nFor SCIM APIs <a href=\"./scim.html\">see the SCIM documentation</a>.\n<br/><br/>\nFor New, V2 APIs <a href=\"./api-v2.html\">see the V2 API documentation</a>.\n<br/><br/>\nTo use the Common Room API, or get started with the Common Room Zapier integration, you will need to create an API token.\nTo create an API token:\n<ol>\n  <li>Navigate to Setting | API tokens\n  <li>Create a “New Token\"\n</ol>\n\n# Authentication\n\n<!-- ReDoc-Inject: <security-definitions> -->",
